== Bugs ==
{{bug|dlc=a+nr|Mom's Knife + {{i|Haemolacria}}: Causes the crosshair to follow the camera instead of player input. In normal rooms this makes the crosshair get stuck in the middle. In larger rooms, the marker will only move when the camera moves, allowing for minimal control when aiming due to how the camera moves based on the direction Isaac is currently aiming.}}

